WEBVTT

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:05.980
<b>Direct Line</b>

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:05.980
<b>Gion & Kiyomizu by HANKEI Railway</b>

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:05.980
<b>Your Personalized Wedding Venue</b>

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:15.690
I'd like to exercise your punishment now.

00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:19.580
Go on a date with me tomorrow.

00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:23.370
<i>What on earth is that boy planning?</i>

00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:25.950
<i>I mean...</i>

00:00:25.950 --> 00:00:30.340
<i>I feel like going on a date is a direct 
violation of our rules in and of itself.</i>

00:00:30.980 --> 00:00:32.010
<i>No...</i>

00:00:32.010 --> 00:00:37.540
<i>Plenty of close siblings go out 
together on their days off, right?</i>

00:00:38.010 --> 00:00:41.850
<i>Surely they meet up outside of home too.</i>

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:46.390
<i>That's right! This is a healthy part 
of any stepsibling relationship!</i>

00:00:47.350 --> 00:00:49.610
Sorry. I got held up.

00:00:59.300 --> 00:01:04.370
You're Irido Mizuto, right? 
My younger stepbrother?

00:01:04.890 --> 00:01:08.570
Yes, I'm Irido Mizuto. 
Your <i>older</i> stepbrother.

00:01:11.340 --> 00:01:13.960
<i>H... H-H-He's...</i>

00:01:14.460 --> 00:01:17.270
<i>so handsome!</i>

00:01:27.310 --> 00:01:29.360
<b>My Stepmom's 
Daughter Is 
My Ex</b>

00:02:49.140 --> 00:02:53.980
<b>That's Not What You're Supposed to Say</b>

00:02:53.330 --> 00:02:55.020
Pretty long line, huh?

00:02:55.310 --> 00:02:56.460
Looks like it.

00:02:57.050 --> 00:02:59.700
Still, I reckon it won't take too long.

00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:03.280
<i>We look just like a real couple.</i>

00:03:04.040 --> 00:03:08.630
<i>Only couples and families visit
 the aquarium together, don't they?</i>

00:03:09.030 --> 00:03:13.110
<i>Why did he decide to bring me here? 
It's not like we're on a date.</i>

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:17.750
<i>Oh, wait... We </i>are<i> on a date, aren't we?</i>

00:03:22.550 --> 00:03:24.090
<i>Oh no!</i>

00:03:24.090 --> 00:03:27.320
<i>He's totally giving off intellectual yet 
charming young man with baggage vibes!</i>

00:03:27.720 --> 00:03:31.640
<i>Crap! He's like my dream boy come to life!</i>

00:03:31.640 --> 00:03:33.650
<b>Admission</b>

00:03:31.640 --> 00:03:33.650
