00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:33.650
<i>Oh crap!</i>

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:35.900
Two high school student tickets, please.

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:35.900
<i>Oh crap, oh crap!</i>

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:39.110
<i>Oh crap, oh crap, oh crap!</i>

00:03:36.300 --> 00:03:39.150
Two high school student tickets?

00:03:39.150 --> 00:03:40.680
That'll be 3,000 yen.

00:03:39.730 --> 00:03:41.690
<i>D-Don't do it!</i>

00:03:41.690 --> 00:03:43.710
<i>Hold back that grin!</i>

00:03:43.710 --> 00:03:46.860
Hello? I got the tickets.

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:49.240
Good.

00:03:49.240 --> 00:03:51.210
Well, let's get a move on, then.

00:03:51.210 --> 00:03:52.410
All right.

00:03:54.800 --> 00:03:56.500
<i>H-H-H-H-He's...</i>

00:03:56.500 --> 00:04:00.010
<i>h-h-h-h-holding my hand!</i>

00:04:00.010 --> 00:04:02.970
Wow, those two seem pretty close, huh?

00:04:02.970 --> 00:04:04.930
Hey, try not to stare.

00:04:04.930 --> 00:04:08.560
<i>It's all right. We're not 
actually that close, but...</i>

00:04:08.560 --> 00:04:10.560
<i>You can keep staring!</i>

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:13.560
<b>Japanese Giant 
Salamander Illustration</b>

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:13.560
<b>Our Huge Giant
 Salamander Exhibit!!</b>

00:04:23.250 --> 00:04:24.810
You with me, Irido?

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:27.210
Our mission on today's date

00:04:27.210 --> 00:04:30.430
is to get the unrivaled lunatic Minami Akatsuki

00:04:30.430 --> 00:04:34.390
to give up her obsession with Irido-san.

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:36.420
And so, fresh into high school,

00:04:36.540 --> 00:04:40.420
we're gonna make Irido Yume's 
brother complex a reality!

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:44.510
When Minami sees that Irido-san 
only has eyes for you,

00:04:44.510 --> 00:04:48.040
her impulsive dreams of marrying 
into the family will be shattered.

00:04:48.430 --> 00:04:52.440
Once she finds out the two
 of you are going on a date,

00:04:52.440 --> 00:04:54.390
she won't hesitate to come sneak a peek.

00:04:54.390 --> 00:04:57.150
So don't let this opportunity go to waste.

00:04:58.070 --> 00:05:00.490
You gotta whisk Irido-san off her feet.

00:05:00.490 --> 00:05:04.220
Show Minami a couple madly in love,
 and her heart'll just...

00:05:05.180 --> 00:05:07.050
<i>snap</i> right in two.

00:05:07.970 --> 00:05:09.250
Want some?

00:05:09.250 --> 00:05:10.910
I'll pass.

00:05:21.400 --> 00:05:23.180
<i>I get his logic.</i>

00:05:23.670 --> 00:05:24.570
<i>However...</i>

00:05:25.490 --> 00:05:28.320
<i>Since I can't tell her about Minami,</i>

00:05:28.320 --> 00:05:30.970
<i>there's no way for me
 to explain the situation.</i>

00:05:31.960 --> 00:05:35.230
<i>I just have to play the jerk
 trying to win back</i>

00:05:35.230 --> 00:05:38.810
<i>the ex he broke up with
once the honeymoon phase was over.</i>

00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:41.730
<i>Kill me now.</i>

00:05:42.610 --> 00:05:43.950
Listen good, Irido.

00:05:43.950 --> 00:05:46.160
What I'm about to tell you is invaluable.

00:05:46.160 --> 00:05:50.070
You must always compliment 
a girl's outfit. Always.

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:57.050
<i>I've confirmed my target's location
 and I'm ready for action.</i>

00:05:57.050 --> 00:06:02.090
<i>I'll strike now and, with any luck,
 the attack will hit Minami too.</i>

00:06:03.900 --> 00:06:07.820
<i>Actually, doesn't she seem a 
little livelier than usual?</i>

00:06:10.710 --> 00:06:11.550
Hey...

00:06:11.550 --> 00:06:13.470
Wh-What's up?

00:06:13.470 --> 00:06:17.300
Did you know this fish tank 
is famous for its size?

00:06:17.700 --> 00:06:20.970
Y-Yeah, it does seem pretty big.

00:06:21.740 --> 00:06:24.360
<i>Damn it. I lost my nerve.</i>

00:06:24.360 --> 00:06:26.720
<i>This is way out of my comfort zone.</i>

00:06:26.720 --> 00:06:28.660
<i>Ergo, I blame Kawanami.</i>

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:32.040
<i>What I'm about to tell you is invaluable.</i>

00:06:32.040 --> 00:06:35.910
<i>You must always compliment 
a girl's outfit. Always.</i>

00:06:38.210 --> 00:06:39.620
You look...

00:06:40.670 --> 00:06:43.250
strangely cute today, huh?

00:06:44.450 --> 00:06:46.260
<i>I-I messed up.</i>

00:06:46.650 --> 00:06:49.050
<i>I accidentally deployed my usual sarcasm!</i>

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:50.840
<i>This is bad!</i>

00:06:51.360 --> 00:06:52.150
Th...

00:06:52.930 --> 00:06:54.300
Thank you.

00:06:56.560 --> 00:06:57.710
<i>Hold up.</i>

00:06:57.710 --> 00:06:59.080
<i>Wait, wait, wait, wait!</i>

00:06:59.530 --> 00:07:03.000
<i>That is </i>not<i> the response 
of a girl who's dated before.</i>

00:07:03.500 --> 00:07:06.140
<i>More like a middle schooler 
talking to their first crush!</i>

00:07:06.140 --> 00:07:09.460
<i>Get it together, Miss High School Debut!</i>

00:07:11.270 --> 00:07:16.330
<i>I guess I'll just have
 to show you how it's done.</i>

00:07:21.410 --> 00:07:23.170
S-Sure...

00:07:26.420 --> 00:07:29.750
See? Like a house on fire, aren't they?

00:07:30.280 --> 00:07:31.430
Are they?

00:07:49.190 --> 00:07:51.020
Oh, excuse us.

00:07:49.190 --> 00:07:51.450
Look at the fishies!

00:07:51.450 --> 00:07:53.020
They didn't bump into you, did they?

00:07:53.450 --> 00:07:55.740
<i>Hang on! He's so close!</i>

00:07:55.740 --> 00:07:57.240
<i>And he smells so nice!</i>

00:07:57.800 --> 00:08:00.920
<i>Gimme a break! What's with him today?!</i>

00:08:00.920 --> 00:08:03.710
<i>Such a gentlemen! And so sweet!</i>

00:08:03.710 --> 00:08:07.460
<i>His every move has me 
feeling weak in the knees...</i>

00:08:09.650 --> 00:08:12.170
How long do you plan on holding my shoulder?

00:08:12.170 --> 00:08:14.460
O-Oh, my bad.

00:08:14.840 --> 00:08:17.450
There are a lot of people 
around, so stay close.

00:08:17.450 --> 00:08:20.760
You needn't keep reminding me, you know?

00:08:20.760 --> 00:08:22.570
I'm not a child.

00:08:23.720 --> 00:08:25.100
You're right.

00:08:26.160 --> 00:08:27.210
<i>Huh?</i>

00:08:27.590 --> 00:08:31.960
<i>I thought my response sounded 
pretty snarky just now.</i>

00:08:31.960 --> 00:08:34.360
<i>Where's his comeback? The snide retort?</i>

00:08:34.670 --> 00:08:38.280
<i>Did you leave your stock 
contemptuous laugh at home?</i>

00:08:40.800 --> 00:08:44.560
<i>When I look at the tank, 
she sneaks a glance at me.</i>

00:08:44.560 --> 00:08:47.580
<i>And when I pull her close 
to keep her from getting bumped,</i>

00:08:47.580 --> 00:08:49.690
<i>her gaze turns into a piercing glare.</i>

00:08:51.360 --> 00:08:52.970
<i>Even now...</i>

00:08:53.390 --> 00:08:54.970
<i>she's still staring at me.</i>

00:08:55.800 --> 00:08:59.220
<i>Why are dates... such a struggle?</i>

00:09:04.230 --> 00:09:05.820
You sound like a pig, you know?

00:09:05.820 --> 00:09:06.730
Oink!

00:09:07.240 --> 00:09:11.190
Help me, Kawanami.
We look so awkward together.

00:09:11.190 --> 00:09:15.160
Really? Is that how it looks to you?

00:09:15.160 --> 00:09:17.580
<i>Of course it does. I'm not blind.</i>

00:09:18.070 --> 00:09:21.290
Well, I <i>will</i> say this...

00:09:22.870 --> 00:09:25.660
I'll leave the judgment calls 
to the man on the front line.

00:09:25.660 --> 00:09:27.640
<i>Hey, quit making me do all the work.</i>

00:09:27.640 --> 00:09:29.710
<i>Hold up your end of the bargain, Commander!</i>

00:09:34.520 --> 00:09:37.950
<i>Whatever the circumstances, 
I'm the one who asked her out.</i>

00:09:37.950 --> 00:09:40.930
<i>I shouldn't do anything that 
might jeopardize our date.</i>

00:09:42.470 --> 00:09:43.680
<i>Still...</i>

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:47.670
<i>This is on her for making friends 
with an unrepentant menace.</i>

00:09:48.360 --> 00:09:53.190
<i>Why am I bending over backward 
for someone who isn't even my girlfriend?</i>

00:09:57.170 --> 00:09:59.530
<i>I've made three miscalculations.</i>

00:09:59.950 --> 00:10:04.300
<i>First, the line for the girl's bathroom 
was so long that I didn't want to wait,</i>

00:10:04.300 --> 00:10:08.580
<i>but when I went to look for another one, 
it was farther away than I thought.</i>

00:10:09.040 --> 00:10:12.310
<i>Second, the aquarium's layout is 
far more complicated than I thought.</i>

00:10:12.790 --> 00:10:17.580
<i>And lastly, I'm terrible at reading maps.</i>

00:10:17.580 --> 00:10:18.930
<i>All this is to say...</i>

00:10:19.490 --> 00:10:22.680
<i>As hard as it is to admit, I'm lost.</i>

00:10:24.180 --> 00:10:27.180
<i>Why am I always like this?!</i>

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:34.110
Irido Mizuto

00:10:36.560 --> 00:10:38.000
Hello?

00:10:38.000 --> 00:10:40.870
<i>Hello. Where are you right now?</i>

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:45.420
Under the sky?

00:10:45.900 --> 00:10:47.140
<i>Right...</i>

00:10:48.520 --> 00:10:50.810
I-I'm sorry.

00:10:51.330 --> 00:10:54.010
<i>Here comes the flood of sarcastic comments.</i>

00:10:54.010 --> 00:10:57.200
<i>He'd never pass up this chance to 
unleash a storm of personal attacks.</i>

00:10:57.200 --> 00:10:59.340
<i>I can just see his snide face now.</i>

00:10:59.960 --> 00:11:03.510
<i>But right now, I couldn't even argue.</i>

00:11:04.480 --> 00:11:07.260
<i>No, it's not like you did anything wrong.</i>

00:11:08.200 --> 00:11:10.520
<i>It's my fault for not 
keeping an eye on you.</i>

00:11:11.080 --> 00:11:12.630
<i>Stay put.</i>

00:11:13.150 --> 00:11:14.760
<i>I'll come get you, so don't go—</i>

00:11:14.760 --> 00:11:15.650
No.

00:11:17.320 --> 00:11:19.130
That's not what you're supposed to say.

00:11:19.700 --> 00:11:20.650
<i>Huh?</i>

00:11:26.600 --> 00:11:27.990
What does that mean?

00:11:28.950 --> 00:11:31.100
What was I supposed to say?

00:11:32.040 --> 00:11:34.000
<b>My Stepmom's Daughter Is My Ex</b>

00:11:37.780 --> 00:11:39.540
<i>Why did he say that?</i>

00:11:39.970 --> 00:11:43.370
<i>He's being so nice to me today.</i>

00:11:43.370 --> 00:11:45.960
<i>Charming and kind. A true gentlemen.</i>

00:11:46.380 --> 00:11:48.460
<i>It's far better than the usual tempest</i>

00:11:48.460 --> 00:11:50.880
<i>of mockery and cynical comments.</i>

00:11:50.880 --> 00:11:53.950
<i>This is infinitely preferable
 to the infuriating and incessant</i>

00:11:53.950 --> 00:11:56.120
<i>bickering we always fall into.</i>

00:11:56.120 --> 00:11:57.520
<i>And yet...</i>

00:11:58.310 --> 00:12:01.700
<i>What is it that I want, exactly?</i>

00:12:02.380 --> 00:12:05.530
<i>Here I am becoming a burden 
to him all over again...</i>

00:12:06.500 --> 00:12:10.320
<i>Looking back, I can only describe 
it as a youthful indiscretion.</i>

00:12:10.320 --> 00:12:14.010
<i>But from my second to third 
year of middle school,</i>

00:12:14.010 --> 00:12:17.140
<i>I had what you might call a boyfriend.</i>

00:12:18.300 --> 00:12:21.750
<i>Before we officially started dating,</i>

00:12:21.750 --> 00:12:25.740
<i>we only ever spoke when we saw 
each other in the school library.</i>

00:12:25.740 --> 00:12:28.320
<i>But one day, I mustered all my courage</i>

00:12:28.320 --> 00:12:31.080
<i>and asked someone out for 
the first time in my life.</i>

00:12:32.280 --> 00:12:37.190
<i>The local festival we visited was far 
more crowded than we expected.</i>

00:12:37.710 --> 00:12:39.700
<i>We ended up getting separated.</i>

00:12:40.570 --> 00:12:43.050
<i>I made a fool of myself 
on my very first date.</i>

00:12:43.450 --> 00:12:45.960
<i>Between knowing each precious moment
 that passed was wasted time</i>

00:12:46.820 --> 00:12:49.830
<i>and the pain from the unforgiving straps
 on my geta sandals,</i>

00:12:50.960 --> 00:12:53.720
<i>I've never wanted to disappear 
more in my entire life.</i>

00:12:54.860 --> 00:12:57.530
<i>Through all my sniffling and whimpering,</i>

00:12:57.530 --> 00:13:00.470
<i>I apologized to him profusely over the phone.</i>

00:13:00.970 --> 00:13:03.240
<i>But he just told me to "stay put"</i>

00:13:03.240 --> 00:13:05.090
<i>before hanging up.</i>

00:13:05.830 --> 00:13:09.590
<i>I was always clumsy and inelegant. 
A failure at everything I did.</i>

00:13:10.080 --> 00:13:12.440
<i>And I always resented myself for it.</i>

00:13:13.100 --> 00:13:16.470
<i>But I never wanted to be a burden to others.</i>

00:13:16.970 --> 00:13:20.980
<i>At the very least, I didn't want the guy 
I liked to think I was a burden.</i>

00:13:21.690 --> 00:13:25.450
<i>But I got greedy, carried away,
 and overconfident.</i>

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:27.050
<i>And that was the price I paid.</i>

00:13:28.490 --> 00:13:34.620
<i>When all I could think was that the 
world would be better off without me,</i>

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:38.710
<i>he reached out to offer me a drink</i>

00:13:40.870 --> 00:13:42.970
<i>and said this to me...</i>

00:13:44.200 --> 00:13:45.960
You know, Ayai,

00:13:45.960 --> 00:13:51.530
I'm honestly pretty worn out after
 having to find you in this crowd.

00:13:51.530 --> 00:13:54.670
And listening to all that crying over the phone

00:13:54.670 --> 00:13:56.460
left me pretty drained mentally too.

00:13:56.890 --> 00:13:58.270
But you know what?

00:13:58.270 --> 00:14:02.200
None of that changes how I think of you.

00:14:03.040 --> 00:14:07.100
I already knew you can be clumsy 
and a little inelegant sometimes.

00:14:07.100 --> 00:14:09.720
And today, I learned you get lost easily too.

00:14:10.470 --> 00:14:14.160
But even knowing all of that, 
I'm not going anywhere.

00:14:14.680 --> 00:14:16.470
So you don't have to be afraid.

00:14:16.940 --> 00:14:18.360
No matter what...

00:14:25.670 --> 00:14:26.780
I wanna go home...

00:14:38.080 --> 00:14:40.150
<i>So you don't have to be afraid.</i>

00:14:41.240 --> 00:14:42.980
<i>No matter what...</i>

00:14:43.560 --> 00:14:45.900
<i>you can always rely on me.</i>

00:15:00.740 --> 00:15:03.370
I have come to collect you, my lady.

00:15:04.090 --> 00:15:07.820
I daresay it might behoove you
 to improve your sense of direction.

00:15:11.820 --> 00:15:13.230
What was that?

00:15:13.230 --> 00:15:15.970
Your sense of humor never ceases to amaze me.

00:15:15.970 --> 00:15:17.980
What did you just say?

00:15:17.980 --> 00:15:19.400
All right, I've got it.

00:15:19.400 --> 00:15:21.610
We settle this with a bibliobattle.

00:15:21.610 --> 00:15:22.600
Let's do this.

00:15:22.970 --> 00:15:25.020
Then I'll go first.

00:15:25.020 --> 00:15:28.240
<i>The Nonserial Murders</i> by Sakaguchi Ango.

00:15:28.240 --> 00:15:30.030
Then I'll go next.

00:15:30.030 --> 00:15:31.990
"The Dancing Girl" by Mori Ogai.

00:15:31.990 --> 00:15:35.870
Don't you dare remind me 
about that scumbag Toyotaro!

00:15:35.870 --> 00:15:39.910
Last I checked, <i>The Nonserial Murders</i>
 is a parade of scumbags.

00:15:39.910 --> 00:15:41.840
Most of them die in the end, so who cares?

00:15:41.840 --> 00:15:42.720
Oh?

00:15:42.720 --> 00:15:43.500
So what?

00:15:43.500 --> 00:15:45.950
It's all good as long as
 the bad guys kick the bucket?

00:15:43.880 --> 00:15:46.350
They seem like they're having fun.

00:15:45.950 --> 00:15:47.470
That's not what I meant.

00:15:50.800 --> 00:15:54.140
Can't you just imagine dead 
bodies floating around in there?

00:15:54.140 --> 00:15:57.060
Should we move this date to a mental
 institution, Miss Mystery Buff?

00:15:57.450 --> 00:16:00.860
Come on. Don't tell me you don't see it.

00:16:01.320 --> 00:16:04.940
Amongst the gracefully drifting jellyfish,

00:16:04.940 --> 00:16:08.300
broken remains of corpses 
gently sway to and fro...

00:16:08.300 --> 00:16:11.360
What a mystery that would make.

00:16:11.360 --> 00:16:14.660
Never in my wildest dreams have 
I had such a disturbing thought.

00:16:15.160 --> 00:16:17.530
The best twist I can conceive is that

00:16:17.530 --> 00:16:20.160
some man-eating shark
 appeared in the Kamo River

00:16:20.160 --> 00:16:24.520
and devoured each and every couple 
that dared to sit on its banks.

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:27.600
Your idea sounds way more disturbing!

00:16:27.600 --> 00:16:31.380
Besides, there's no way a shark could 
swim in such a shallow river.

00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:35.130
Sharks possess limitless ability, 
so it's quite possible.

00:16:35.130 --> 00:16:37.390
No, they don't. They're fish.

00:16:37.390 --> 00:16:40.560
All right, then.
 Why don't we test that theory?

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:44.000
I can't wait to see you cower in fear,

00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:47.150
helpless but to bow down to 
the shark's infinite power.

00:16:47.900 --> 00:16:50.730
What makes you so confident?

00:16:50.730 --> 00:16:54.170
You sound more arrogant than a serial 
killer with a mythological sobriquet

00:16:54.170 --> 00:16:55.360
announcing his next crime.

00:16:55.680 --> 00:16:57.870
What'd you say, stupid nerd?

00:16:57.870 --> 00:16:59.950
You got a problem, stupid geek?

00:17:03.720 --> 00:17:06.190
<i>In the six months since 
our problems started,</i>

00:17:06.190 --> 00:17:10.250
<i>I slowly began to hate 
her as the days went by.</i>

00:17:10.250 --> 00:17:15.000
<i>Everything she did and everything she
 said started getting on my nerves.</i>

00:17:16.370 --> 00:17:18.580
<i>That was the most painful part of it.</i>

00:17:20.290 --> 00:17:22.590
<i>What I'd loved about her more than anything...</i>

00:17:22.590 --> 00:17:24.700
<i>What I'd so cherished about her...</i>

00:17:24.700 --> 00:17:29.450
<i>One after the other, my love for them
 turned to hatred. It was torment.</i>

00:17:31.590 --> 00:17:32.890
<i>That's why we broke up.</i>

00:17:36.450 --> 00:17:38.000
<i>And so...</i>

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:41.450
<i>now freed from the romantic 
bond that once held us,</i>

00:17:41.940 --> 00:17:44.190
<i>we have no obligation to
 try to love one another,</i>

00:17:44.190 --> 00:17:46.550
<i>and no reason to come to hate one another.</i>

00:17:47.490 --> 00:17:51.320
<i>We're just stepsiblings who used
 to date once upon a time.</i>

00:17:52.530 --> 00:17:54.140
<i>Yes, I understand now.</i>

00:17:55.560 --> 00:18:00.600
<i>Our situation now is a blessing compared 
to the unhealthy relationship we had before.</i>

00:18:03.600 --> 00:18:05.640
All right, I'll head home first.

00:18:06.060 --> 00:18:07.060
Sure.

00:18:10.840 --> 00:18:15.150
<i>Going home separately thus 
concludes our date at the aquarium.</i>

00:18:15.150 --> 00:18:16.260
<i>All that's left is...</i>

00:18:17.700 --> 00:18:20.070
Got it

00:18:17.700 --> 00:18:20.070
Got it

00:18:17.820 --> 00:18:20.070
We're inside

00:18:17.820 --> 00:18:20.070
Kawanami

00:18:17.820 --> 00:18:20.070
Kawanami

00:18:17.820 --> 00:18:20.070
Read

00:18:17.820 --> 00:18:20.070
Read

00:18:18.070 --> 00:18:20.070
She's coming

00:18:21.250 --> 00:18:22.840
Wow!

00:18:24.780 --> 00:18:28.040
Hey, Irido-kun! Fancy seeing you here.

00:18:28.540 --> 00:18:31.790
Yeah. What a coincidence, Minami-san.

00:18:37.550 --> 00:18:38.540
I'm sorry!

00:18:38.540 --> 00:18:41.550
I really shouldn't have snuck 
into your house like that!

00:18:41.550 --> 00:18:43.360
I didn't mean any harm.

00:18:43.360 --> 00:18:49.310
You forgot to lock the front door, 
so I just couldn't help myself, you know?

00:18:52.500 --> 00:18:54.520
You're gonna tell Yume-chan, aren't you?

00:18:54.960 --> 00:18:56.650
About me.

00:19:00.600 --> 00:19:02.190
Don't worry. I won't.

00:19:02.190 --> 00:19:03.950
As long as you promise to behave.

00:19:03.950 --> 00:19:06.450
What? But why?

00:19:06.780 --> 00:19:10.900
Because you're her friend 
and you mean a lot to her.

00:19:14.800 --> 00:19:16.070
So that's it.

00:19:18.020 --> 00:19:19.710
I'm not gonna thank you, you know.

00:19:19.710 --> 00:19:20.810
You had better.

00:19:20.810 --> 00:19:22.890
You should be on your knees right now.

00:19:29.490 --> 00:19:31.020
By the way...

00:19:31.690 --> 00:19:36.110
What exactly made you think to leave 
an extra chair at our dining table?

00:19:37.810 --> 00:19:39.610
What are you talking about?

00:19:39.610 --> 00:19:40.410
Huh?

00:19:42.070 --> 00:19:44.640
I'm kidding, I'm kidding. It was a joke!

00:19:44.640 --> 00:19:45.520
Hey...

00:19:45.520 --> 00:19:48.140
It was just a little make-believe, you know?

00:19:48.140 --> 00:19:50.580
Man, I'm really sorry about that!

00:19:50.910 --> 00:19:52.480
From now on, I'll behave

00:19:52.480 --> 00:19:55.250
and shamelessly invite myself 
over as her dear friend.

00:19:55.250 --> 00:19:56.250
Hey now.

00:19:56.780 --> 00:19:59.480
You clearly haven't given backing off

00:19:59.480 --> 00:20:01.760
even the slightest thought, have you?

00:20:02.550 --> 00:20:04.060
About that...

00:20:04.060 --> 00:20:06.470
I still plan on marrying you and
living together, you hear?

00:20:06.470 --> 00:20:09.220
Haven't given up on that, huh?

00:20:09.220 --> 00:20:11.260
When crushing one's rivals in love,

00:20:11.260 --> 00:20:14.970
the best course of action is to 
force your way between them,

00:20:14.970 --> 00:20:16.190
don'tcha think?

00:20:16.190 --> 00:20:18.690
Irido

00:20:21.050 --> 00:20:23.950
<i>I can't wrap my head around any of it.</i>

00:20:24.480 --> 00:20:27.680
<i>Why he suddenly asked me out on a date</i>

00:20:27.680 --> 00:20:31.790
<i>and that pair of shoes I found
 by the door are both still mysteries.</i>

00:20:32.090 --> 00:20:33.500
<i>If this were a novel,</i>

00:20:34.120 --> 00:20:36.060
<i>I'd be a failure of a detective.</i>

00:20:36.060 --> 00:20:38.900
<i>Well, in any case, the date is over now.</i>

00:20:40.020 --> 00:20:41.120
<i>No!</i>

00:20:41.120 --> 00:20:43.720
<i>I'm not gonna let it end like this!</i>

00:20:43.720 --> 00:20:44.940
I'm home.

00:20:49.190 --> 00:20:52.480
Tonight is the night I capture my 
little brother's shining moment.

00:20:53.600 --> 00:20:54.730
Huh?

00:20:54.980 --> 00:20:58.730
The Nonserial Murders
Sakaguchi Ango\h\h\h\hKadokawa Shoten

00:20:55.920 --> 00:20:58.230
Your punishment for the underwear incident.

00:20:59.510 --> 00:21:00.980
Cross your legs!

00:21:02.310 --> 00:21:03.990
Yes, that's it!

00:21:04.710 --> 00:21:05.990
Gorgeous!

00:21:05.990 --> 00:21:07.440
Stunning!

00:21:09.280 --> 00:21:10.990
Now rest your cheek on your hand!

00:21:11.320 --> 00:21:12.200
Like this?

00:21:12.200 --> 00:21:13.500
Yes, just like that!

00:21:14.230 --> 00:21:16.000
This is perfect!

00:21:16.000 --> 00:21:18.500
The Nonserial Murders
Sakaguchi Ango\h\h\h\hKadokawa Shoten

00:21:19.630 --> 00:21:21.320
Stop!

00:21:22.010 --> 00:21:24.010
Don't move a muscle!

00:21:25.090 --> 00:21:26.260
That's it!

00:21:27.000 --> 00:21:29.830
Aren't I, your wonderful older sister,

00:21:30.560 --> 00:21:32.770
getting just the best pictures?

00:21:36.220 --> 00:21:38.780
So many hotties in my camera roll...

00:21:38.780 --> 00:21:40.480
Hey, Nee-san?

00:21:40.480 --> 00:21:41.270
Eh?

00:21:41.270 --> 00:21:45.740
While we're at it, I'm willing to take
one more request if you'd like.

00:21:46.690 --> 00:21:49.060
O-Okay, then...

00:21:49.760 --> 00:21:54.950
Would you hug me from behind 
and whisper something in my ear?

00:21:55.720 --> 00:21:57.000
What kind of request is that?

00:21:58.100 --> 00:21:59.720
It's your punishment!

00:21:59.720 --> 00:22:02.710
It has nothing to do with my
 own fantasies whatsoever!

00:22:22.600 --> 00:22:23.860
I've caught you.

00:22:36.640 --> 00:22:38.630
You caught me.

00:22:42.070 --> 00:22:44.550
Morning, Yume-chan!

00:22:44.550 --> 00:22:46.230
Good morning, Minami-san.

00:22:46.740 --> 00:22:48.640
What didja do last Saturday?

00:22:48.640 --> 00:22:50.760
I basically slept the entire day.

00:22:51.050 --> 00:22:53.450
I didn't really do anything special either.

00:22:53.450 --> 00:22:55.180
Just stayed home and read a book.

00:22:55.720 --> 00:22:57.480
You don't say...

00:22:57.480 --> 00:23:01.050
And with that, I'd say case closed.

00:22:57.960 --> 00:23:01.240
What kind of books do you 
read? Like what genre?

00:23:01.050 --> 00:23:03.900
It's still wide open if you ask me.

00:23:01.240 --> 00:23:03.290
I like mystery novels.

00:23:04.360 --> 00:23:08.900
Well, if she does anything weird 
again, just come talk to me.

00:23:09.210 --> 00:23:14.910
When it comes to Minami Akatsuki, 
you won't find a better man for the job.

00:23:15.750 --> 00:23:18.150
Pardon my asking, Kawanami, but...

00:23:18.540 --> 00:23:21.540
Have you ever been hospitalized?

00:23:25.220 --> 00:23:26.220
Sure have.

00:23:26.680 --> 00:23:28.300
Back in middle school, to be exact.

00:23:30.470 --> 00:23:32.810
We both have it rough, don't we?

00:23:32.810 --> 00:23:34.300
You might be right.

00:23:35.040 --> 00:23:36.430
I'll bring it with me tomorrow.

00:23:36.430 --> 00:23:39.130
Really?! Sweet!
